<main class="min-h-screen overflow-hidden">
  <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-7 lg:px-10">
    <%= link_to root_path, class: "font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" do %>
      signal / feedback
    <% end %>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-semibold">
      <span class="hidden text-[#6f7973] sm:inline">A private space for useful truth.</span>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", new_user_session_path, class: "border-b-2 border-[#ef806d] pb-1" %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-14 px-6 pb-20 pt-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] lg:items-center lg:px-10 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-24">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#ef806d]">Client feedback, made human</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[.98] tracking-[-.06em] sm:text-7xl lg:text-[5.9rem]">Make room for the words that move the work.</h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#617069]">One calm place for clients to send notes, images, and voice. One clear view for your team to spot what matters next.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5">
        <%= link_to "Open your workspace", signup_path, class: "rounded-full bg-[#ef806d] px-6 py-4 text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1e2825] shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(239,128,109,.25)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5" %>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7d8982]">NO CREDIT CARD / NO NOISE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative min-h-[420px] lg:min-h-[500px]">
      <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#d8e9d7] sm:h-96 sm:w-96"></div>
      <div class="absolute left-4 top-12 z-10 w-[min(100%,380px)] rotate-[-4deg] rounded-[2rem] bg-[#1e2825] p-7 text-[#f4f1e9] shadow-2xl sm:left-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#9eb3a5]"><span>latest signal</span><span>08:42</span></div>
        <p class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight">“The flow feels right now. The handoff is where we lose people.”</p>
        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/15 pt-4 text-xs text-[#9eb3a5]"><span>maya / northstar</span><span class="text-[#ef806d]">● voice note</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-0 z-20 w-56 rotate-[6deg] rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#1e2825]/10 bg-white/80 p-5 shadow-xl backdrop-blur sm:right-8"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#ef806d]">this week</p><p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold">24</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[#6f7973]">thoughts worth keeping</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[#1e2825]/10 bg-[#e5eee4]">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-6 py-14 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-10">
      <div><p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ef806d]">01 / collect</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold">Let clients speak naturally.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#617069]">Text, snapshots, and voice notes all belong in the same thread.</p></div>
      <div><p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ef806d]">02 / see</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold">Find the recurring edges.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#617069]">A focused dashboard turns scattered feedback into a shared signal.</p></div>
      <div><p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ef806d]">03 / respond</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-extrabold">Close the loop with care.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#617069]">Keep client history close so the next conversation starts further ahead.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
